    <abstract><![CDATA[The Millbrook Household Money Habits Survey asks one adult in each sampled household how the household holds its money: whether anyone has a current account, how often pay and bills go through it, and how much is still handled in cash.

The 2026 round is the first. It covers 400 households in the five districts of the town and was carried out on the doorstep by trained volunteers during January and February.

The file is meant for neighbourhood groups, the local credit union and anyone planning money advice sessions in the town.]]></abstract>
