      <sampProc><![CDATA[Eighty addresses were drawn at random from the street list of each district. A volunteer called at each address up to three times on different days. Where nobody answered after the third call, the next address on the same street was used instead.

In each household the volunteer asked to speak to the adult who pays most of the bills. If that person was out, any other adult could answer.]]></sampProc>
